# TaskFence needs no environment variables.
#
# There is no backend, no database and no API key anywhere in this project:
# the policy engine is plain TypeScript, documents are read in the browser,
# and the session record is kept in localStorage on the device.
#
# So on Vercel: add nothing under Settings -> Environment Variables.
#
# The one thing you may want to set, and only for your own convenience:
# VITE_PUBLIC_URL=https://your-deployment.vercel.app
